# Deferred: item link visibility sync

**Status:** `item_links.type` is shipping (see `SUPABASE_ITEM_LINKS_TYPE.sql` + `SyncLinkData.type`). Visibility is still local-only.

## Current baseline

- `Link.visibility` and `Item.linkSectionVisibility` are Core Data only.
- Section defaults: Affiliate = public, Purchase / Reference = private.
- Rows may override; mixed sections show `lock.open` locally.
- `SyncLinkData` upserts `id`, `itemId`, `name`, `url`, `type`.

## When revisiting

1. Add `item_links.visibility` (and item-level section map if needed).
2. Include visibility in link upsert / pull.
3. Apply privacy when rendering remote/read-only item detail.
4. Remove this rule once shipping.
